<title>SWEDEN: Swedish ten bln SKR T-bill auction oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Swedish ten bln SKR T-bill auction oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>An auction of ten billion Swedish crowns of Treasury bills was oversubscribed, Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					    190-day bill    336-day bill</p>
<p> Volume issued (billion Skr)	  5.00		5.00</p>
<p> Total bids (billion Skr)	    15.96	     28.77</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		9		  16</p>
<p> Number of bids			  50		  72</p>
<p> Lowest rate				4.185	     4.370</p>
<p> Highest accepted rate		  4.195	     4.382</p>
<p> Weighted average rate		  4.193	     4.379</p>
<p> Percent served at highest rate    57.74	    100</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
